            <h2>Data Source</h2>
            <p>CMS Medicare Monthly Enrollment, national level, January 2013 through March 2026. 159 monthly observations, no gaps. Data is pulled at runtime from the CMS data API, so no raw files are needed to reproduce the analysis.</p>

